<translate>
==== triggerExplosionTimer ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The time after which the item will explode (after activation). Used for items that are thrown.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
triggerExplosionTimer   =   50,
</syntaxhighlight>
